      approach), routed by call shape -- a decode-shaped call (<= 8 jobs)
      takes the int8 quantised dot, a prefill-shaped call keeps the f32 path.
      B60 dense d48q8, 20,085 tokens: prefill 63.1 vs base 64.2 t/s, decode
      6.5 vs base 5.9.
